- PaddleOCR PP-OCRv5 / PP-OCRv4 models and the English recognition
  dictionary, Apache License 2.0, PaddlePaddle / RapidAI.
  `assets/ppocrv5_en_dict.txt` is the English PP-OCRv5 dictionary
